    "chunk_size_bytes": 1790,
    "chunk_text": "Global impact-investing expert Robert Webster to lead Executive Immersion Program in Sri Lanka\n\nGlobal impact-investing expert Robert Webster to lead Executive Immersion Program ahead of Lanka Impact-Investing Forum\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s finance and investment community is set to gain invaluable expertise in impact investing with the arrival of Robert Webster, a globally recognised impact-investing fund manager and adviser, who will lead a two-day Impact-Investment Executive Immersion Program on 9\u201310 February 2026 at Shangri-La Colombo.\n\nThe Executive Immersion Program will serve as a strategic lead-in to the Lanka Impact Investing Forum, Sri Lanka\u2019s flagship national platform for sustainable finance and impact-driven capital mobilisation, scheduled immediately thereafter.\n\nWebster brings over two decades of experience across emerging and frontier markets, where he has led impact finance initiatives, blended finance solutions, and capital mobilisation efforts for small and medium enterprises. His work spans fund structuring, due diligence, impact strategy development, and deal execution across Africa, South Asia, and Southeast Asia.\n\nOrganised by the Lanka Impact Investing Network (LIIN) in partnership with GSG Sri Lanka, the Executive Immersion Program is supported by the Global Affairs Canada (GAC) and implemented with the engagement of World University Service of Canada (WUSC) as part of broader efforts to strengthen inclusive and sustainable finance ecosystems in Sri Lanka.\n\nThe program is designed to equip senior finance professionals\u2014from commercial banks, investment firms, development finance institutions, and other financial intermediaries\u2014with practical tools and frameworks to integrate social and environmental impact into investment decision-making."
  },
