    "chunk_text": "The program is designed to equip senior finance professionals\u2014from commercial banks, investment firms, development finance institutions, and other financial intermediaries\u2014with practical tools and frameworks to integrate social and environmental impact into investment decision-making.\n\nThe two-day program will cover comparative principles of traditional and impact finance, practical application of impact measurement frameworks, real-world case studies, and actionable approaches to mainstreaming impact across institutional portfolios. Upon completion, participants will receive a Certificate of Completion in Impact Investing for Finance Professionals, jointly endorsed by LIIN and GSG Sri Lanka.\n\nParticipation in the Executive Immersion Program will also provide participants with a strong foundation to engage meaningfully in the Lanka Impact Investing Forum, where global investors, development finance institutions, policymakers, and investment-ready enterprises will convene to unlock new impact investment opportunities in Sri Lanka.\n\nRegistrations are open for finance leaders keen on driving sustainable capital allocation and fostering a more inclusive economic future."
