    "description": "Veneration of sacred relics from 4 to 11 February at Hunupitiya Gangaramaya Temple",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Veneration-of-sacred-relics-from-4-to-11-February-at-Hunupitiya-Gangaramaya-Temple/56-787377",
