    "description": "IRONMAN 70.3 Colombo partners Port City Colombo, Shangri-La Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/IRONMAN-70-3-Colombo-partners-Port-City-Colombo-Shangri-La-Colombo/34-787380",
