    "md5": "1b73d54a2d3fb3f5aa8506210ee03bde",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1118,
    "chunk_text": "DFCC Aloka empowers entrepreneurs as key sponsor of women\u2019s awards\n\nDFCC Bank\u2019s women-focused initiative, DFCC Aloka, has reaffirmed its commitment to women entrepreneurs as the diamond sponsor and official banking partner of the Women\u2019s Chamber of Industry and Commerce (WCIC) Prathibhabhisheka Awards 2025.\n\nMarking its fourth consecutive year of support, DFCC Aloka backs this flagship platform that celebrates women-led businesses driving innovation, employment, and inclusive growth across Sri Lanka and the SAARC region.\n\nThrough tailored financial solutions, advisory support, and dedicated partnership, DFCC Aloka aims to empower women entrepreneurs to start, sustain, and scale their ventures. The bank\u2019s leadership emphasised that the partnership reflects a shared mission to combine recognition with practical financial pathways, enabling meaningful economic participation and growth for women in business.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
