    "chunk_text": "Fairway Holdings unveils seventh luxury project in Colombo\n\nFairway Holdings launched its seventh luxury apartment development, \u201cFairway Latitude,\u201d on January 20, 2026, at Cinnamon Life. Located on High Level Road in Kirulapone, Colombo 05, the project marks the group\u2019s first residential venture within Colombo\u2019s central business district.\n\nThe development emphasizes connectivity, situated near key schools, hospitals, and commercial hubs. Amenities include a rooftop infinity pool, a fully equipped gym, a function hall for 250, and a convenience store. Residences range from two to four bedrooms and feature European kitchens, smart-home provisions, and sustainable design elements.\n\nChairman Virath de Alwis stated the project continues Fairway\u2019s commitment to high standards, with construction already underway. CEO Ashean Karthelis highlighted the project\u2019s advanced progress, noting that six floors are already completed, which aims to offer earlier occupancy and a strong return on investment for buyers.\n\nScheduled for completion in 2028, Fairway Latitude expands Fairway Holdings\u2019 portfolio of over 1,000 luxury apartments across Sri Lanka..\n\nIcon V Talpe markets elite beachfront residences to global buyers\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
