    "chunk_text": "INSEE Sanstha Cement crowned Sri Lanka\u2019s Most Awarded Cement Brand in 2025\n\n-Showcases brand as symbol of trust, sustainability, and innovation in Sri Lanka\u2019s construction industry-\n\nAs the only homegrown local brand, INSEE Sanstha Cement dominated industry awards in 2025, securing top honours for quality, sustainability, and innovation, and reinforcing its status as Sri Lanka\u2019s leading and best\u2011performing cement brand.\n\nAt the SLIM Kantar People\u2019s Awards, INSEE Sanstha was once again named \u2018People\u2019s Housing and Construction Brand of the Year\u2019, an unprecedented 14th consecutive win. The recognition proves unmatched consistency for the brand. It positions INSEE Sanstha as the undisputed leader in Sri Lanka\u2019s construction sector and the brand\u2019s enduring trust among builders, contractors, engineers, masons, and homeowners throughout Sri Lanka.\n\nAdding to the historic achievement, INSEE Sanstha was recognised as the \u2018Sustainable Cement Brand of the Year\u2019 by the Ceylon Institute of Builders (CIOB), affirming leadership in the brand\u2019s ability to balance technical excellence with environmentally responsible construction solutions. The brand also received the coveted \u2018People\u2019s Pinnacle \u2013 Best Cement Brand of the Year 2025\u2019, further cementing its reputation as the industry\u2019s benchmark for performance and innovation.\n\nComBank to boost WSME, Agri SME financing with IFC\u2019s US$ 60Mn. risk sharing facility\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
