    "description": "Securing public trust in public office: A Christian perspective \u2013 Part II",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/securing-public-trust-in-public-office-a-christian-perspective-part-ii/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
