    "description": "Sri Lanka must rethink disaster response to break poverty cycles \u2013 Experts",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-must-rethink-disaster-response-to-break-poverty-cycles-Experts/34-787520",
    "lang": "en",
