    "description": "Justice, silence, and the  growing crisis of rape in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Justice-silence-and-the-growing-crisis-of-rape-in-Sri-Lanka/4-787601",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
