    "md5": "b13fa87d6c0a3af47efa47ea3b89e5e5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1970,
    "chunk_text": "Samsung awarded Superbrands Sri Lanka\u2019s Choice 2025  in consumer electronics\n\nSamsung team comprising Managing Director SangHwa Song (third from left) Director and Head of Consumer Electronics Sabry Ansar (third from right) and Assistant Manager Marketing Consumer Electronics Upuli Rathnayake (second from right)\n\nSamsung has been conferred the prestigious Superbrands \u2013 Sri Lanka\u2019s Choice 2025 award, reaffirming the brand\u2019s position as one of the most trusted and admired technology brands in the country.\n\nThe recognition reflects strong consumer preference, sustained brand leadership, and Samsung\u2019s continued commitment to delivering meaningful innovation to Sri Lankan homes.\n\nSuperbrands is globally recognised as one of the most independent and credible authorities on brand excellence. A Superbrand offers consumers significant emotional and physical advantages over other brands that consumers consciously or subconsciously want, recognise, and trust. The Superbrands programme identifies brands that have achieved exceptional standards in quality, reliability, consistency, and emotional connection over time.\n\nThe Superbrands selection process follows a rigorous and transparent methodology. Brands are shortlisted following extensive market research and are evaluated by an independent panel of eminent branding and business professionals, supported by consumer insights. Only a limited number of brands, selected from thousands initially considered, earn Superbrand status, making the endorsement both exclusive and highly respected.\n\nSamsung Sri Lanka Managing Director SangHwa Song said: \u201cThis Superbrands recognition is a strong affirmation of the trust Sri Lankan consumers place in Samsung. It reflects our relentless focus on innovation, quality, and long-term value, as well as our commitment to bringing world-class technology to Sri Lanka. We are honoured to be recognised as a brand that consumers genuinely choose and believe in.\u201d"
  },
