    "chunk_size_bytes": 472,
    "chunk_text": "The Editors\u2019 Guild of Sri Lanka elects new office bearers\n\nThe Annual General Meeting of The Editors\u2019 Guild of Sri Lanka (TEGSL) was held on Tuesday and elected new office bearers for the year 2026-2027.\n\nApex body: Manik De Silva, Sinha Ratnatunga, Siri Ranasinghe, Prabhath Sahabandu\n\nExecutive Committee: Nisthar Cassim (Daily FT), Mahinda Illeperuma (Sathiaga Aruna), Kesara Abeywardena (Daily News), Vindya Amaranayaka (Ceylon Today), Sivaraja Ramasamy (Thamilan)"
  },
  {
