    "chunk_size_bytes": 530,
    "chunk_text": "Special attention has been placed on safeguarding the mental well-being and personal freedom of children during the transition, with the objective of nurturing balanced and resilient future citizens, she said.\n\nCriticising the competitive, exam-driven education model that has prevailed for decades, Dr. Amarasuriya said it has contributed to student dropouts, and reaffirmed that the Government would not step back from its responsibility to keep every child within the education system and ensure equal opportunities to succeed."
