    "chunk_text": "\u200bTaj Samudra marks India\u2019s 77th Republic Day\n\nSamrat Datta, Karan Maini and the Department Heads of Taj Samudra, Colombo\n\nSamrat Datta with Onitha, Shweta, Sashini, Dulari, Dilusha and Thamali of Taj Samudra\n\nSamrat Datta hoisting the Indian Flag during the Republic Day ceremony at Taj Samudra\n\n\u200bArea Director Taj Maldives and Sri Lanka and General Manager of Taj Samudra Samrat Datta during the parade \u200b\n\nTaj Samudra Colombo commemorated India\u2019s 77th Republic Day on its premise on 26 January 2026. The Indian Flag was hoisted by Taj Sri Lanka and Maldives Area Director Samrat Datta, in a ceremony attended by team members and resident guests. The celebration concluded with warm greetings and the enjoyment of delectable refreshments, reflecting the true spirit of unity and togetherness."
