    "description": "State university teachers have their say on general educational reforms, show way forward",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/State-university-teachers-have-their-say-on-general-educational-reforms-show-way-forward/14-787712",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
