    "description": "Softlogic Life\u2019s Lahiru Maduranga takes helm as MDRT Country Chair for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/softlogic-lifes-lahiru-maduranga-takes-helm-as-mdrt-country-chair-for-sri-lanka/",
    "lang": "en",
