    "chunk_text": "The vacuum created by this \u201clost\u201d relationship is being filled rapidly. Prime Minister Modi\u2019s recent engagement with Chinese and Russian leadership marks a return to a more assertive multi-alignment. This shift is not merely symbolic; it represents a strategic choice to diversify dependencies when Western partnerships become unpredictable.\n\nFor the United States to \u201csalvage\u201d this relationship, it must move past transactional \u201cpride and pique\u201d and return to a policy rooted in mutual respect for sovereignty. The longer this crisis lasts, the harder it will be to restore the bond, and the more likely we are to see a fragmented Indo-Pacific that benefits neither Washington nor New Delhi."
