    "chunk_text": "MullenLowe Sri Lanka appoints Harendra Uyanage as Chief Creative Officer\n\nMullenLowe Group Sri Lanka has elevated Harendra Uyanage to Chief Creative Officer, reinforcing its creative leadership.\n\nUyanage, a widely decorated figure with over two decades of experience, is recognised for strategic creativity and filmmaking that drives commercial impact. His leadership has been pivotal in securing multiple Effie awards and steering brand revivals into long-term successes.\n\n\u201cHarendra\u2019s journey exemplifies perseverance and uncompromising creative conviction,\u201d said Thayalan Bartlett, Executive Chairman. \u201cHe has been central to building our reputation and inspiring talent.\u201d\n\nUyanage, the first recipient of the industry\u2019s Next Generation Leader Scholarship, stated his role carries both responsibility and purpose. \u201cI look forward to mentoring the next generation and ensuring Sri Lanka is recognised for leadership in the global creative landscape.\u201d\n\nIn his new role, he will lead the creative vision for Sri Lanka\u2019s largest integrated brand communications company.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
