    "description": "Shameless clicks, broken lives: The social, legal, and ethical cost of viral obscene content",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Shameless-clicks-broken-lives-The-social-legal-and-ethical-cost-of-viral-obscene-content/4-787772",
    "lang": "en",
