    "description": "Verit\u00e9 flags weak oversight and disclosure gaps in Budget 2026 despite PFM Act",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Verit\u00e9-flags-weak-oversight-and-disclosure-gaps-in-Budget-2026-despite-PFM-Act/34-787811",
