    "md5": "339b5636089076136b70d2f2baa8ed03",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 414,
    "chunk_text": "Joining civil society groups, the Church warned that the proposed PSTB risks reproducing the same patterns of repression associated with the PTA. They noted that the draft Bill contains broad and vague definitions of terrorism, allows suspects to be detained without charge for up to one year, and grants security forces powers to stop, search, and arrest individuals, as well as enter premises, without a warrant."
