    "description": "Ilankai Thamil Arasuk Katchi Removes Jaffna MP Sivagnanam  shritharan as ITAK Parliamentary Group Leader and Appoints  Young Batticaloa MP Shanakiyan Rasamanickam as new Parliamentary Leader",
