    "chunk_text": "WindForce secures Letter of Award for 50 MW Mullikulam Wind Power Project \u2013 Lot 1\n\nWindForce PLC has been awarded the official Letter of Award by the Ceylon Electricity Board (CEB) for Lot 1 of the 50 MW Mullikulam Wind Power Project, confirming WindForce\u2019s position as the Lowest Cost Bidder for one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most strategically significant renewable energy developments.\n\nThe award follows the successful completion of all statutory and regulatory approvals, including clearance from the Cabinet Appointed Negotiating Committee (CANC), the Cabinet of Ministers, and the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka (PUCSL)\u2014underscoring the robustness, transparency, and credibility of the national procurement process.\n\nUpping of stake by Senthilverl Holdings in Colombo Dockyard dominates CSE trading\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
