    "description": "Event Management sector officially recognised as an \u2018Industry\u2019 at 7th EMA Annual General Meeting",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Event-Management-sector-officially-recognised-as-an-Industry-at-7th-EMA-Annual-General-Meeting/34-787887",
    "lang": "en",
