    "md5": "47a6e46565ad15627a1e1cc9e782bee5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1652,
    "chunk_text": "JXG earns 2025 Great Place To Work Certification\u2122\n\nJXG (Janashakthi Group) is proud to be Certified\u2122 by Great Place To Work\u00ae. The prestigious award is based entirely on what current employees say about their experience working at JXG. This year, 97% of employees answered positively to the Trust Index\u2122 survey statement \u201cI would say this is a great place to work\u201d.\n\nGreat Place To Work\u00ae is the global authority on workplace culture, employee experience, and the leadership behaviors proven to deliver market-leading revenue, increased employee retention and increased innovation by all.\n\n\u201cGreat Place To Work Certification is a highly coveted achievement that requires consistent and intentional dedication to the overall employee experience,\u201d says Sarah Lewis-Kulin, the Vice President of Global Recognition at Great Place To Work. She emphasizes that Great Place To Work Certification is the sole official recognition earned by the structured recent feedback of all employees regarding their organizational culture. \u201cBy successfully earning this recognition, it is evident that JXG stands out as one of the top companies to work for, providing a great workplace environment for its employees.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe\u2019re proud to receive this recognition, as we know our strength comes from the happiness of our teams\u201d, commented Wasanthi Stephen, Group Chief Human Resources Officer at JXG. \u201cBeing Great Place To Work Certified\u2122 reaffirms our endeavors to invest in people. More importantly, it validates our continued efforts to create an inclusive culture for our employees that facilitates collaboration, innovation, and excellence.\u201d"
