    "chunk_text": "The AGM was attended by Chief Guest Acting Indian High Commissioner to Sri Lanka Dr. Satyanjal Pandey, representing High Commissioner Santosh Jha, and Guest of Honour Oniverse Group Founder Dr. Sandro Veronesi. Proceedings included remarks by the Chief Guest and Guest of Honour, the Chairperson\u2019s address, and the launch of SLAEA\u2019s revamped website.\n\nThe AGM also recognised the presence of Joint Apparel Association Forum (JAAF) representatives Felix Fernando and Yohan Lawrence, underscoring continued industry alignment on trade, competitiveness and export reform priorities.\n\nFrom left: Ambassador for Italy in Sri Lanka Damiano Francovigh, MAS Holdings Deputy Chairman and Co-Founder Sharad Amalean, Oniverse Group Head of International Production Riccardo Romani, US Embassy in Sri Lanka Deputy Chief of Mission Jayne Howell, Industries and Entrepreneurship Development Deputy Minister Chathuranga Abeysinghe and Hirdaramani Group Chairman Vinod Hirdramani\n\nSLAEA Executive Committee and officials (from left): Hasib Omar (Treasurer), Indika Liyanahewage (Immediate Past Chairperson), Rajitha Jayasuriya (Chairperson), Dr. Satyanjal Pandey (Acting Indian High Commissioner to Sri Lanka), Dr. Sandro Veronesi (Founder of Oniverse), Felix Fernando (Chairperson, JAAF), Jeevith Senaratne (Deputy Chairperson)"
